OL,3,GNEWSA'Dissident republicans may be
OL,4,Aresponsible' for hotel explosive device
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice believe dissident republicans
OL,7,Fmay be responsible for a "viable postal
OL,8,Fdevice" which was delivered to a hotel
OL,9,Fin Londonderry.
OL,11,FAmmunition Technical Officers (ATO)
OL,12,Fwere tasked to the hotel at Ebrington
OL,13,FSquare in the Waterside after the
OL,14,Fpackage was discovered at about 15:20
OL,15,FGMT on Tuesday.
OL,17,FThey carried out a controlled explosion
OL,18,Fon the device, which was later taken
OL,19,Faway for a forensic examination.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
