OL,3,GNEWSA'Dissident republicans may be
OL,4,Aresponsible' for hotel explosive device
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) Chief Supt Gillian Kearney
OL,8,Fcondemned it as "shameful and utterly
OL,9,Fabhorrent", adding that "those
OL,10,Fresponsible clearly do not care who or
OL,11,Fwhat they harm".
